  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><h2>About Us – Beauty Buddy</h2><p>Beauty Buddy is an online destination for <strong>Thai beauty and skincare</strong>, curated and shipped directly from Thailand to customers worldwide 🌏</p><p>We specialize in bringing the best of Thai beauty to international markets, with a strong customer base across the <strong>United States, Australia, and Europe</strong>. Our platform connects global consumers with high-quality, trend-driven products that are loved in Thailand.</p><hr><h2>🌟 What We Do</h2><p>We carefully select products from trusted Thai brands—ranging from skincare and cosmetics to self-care essentials—focusing on items that are:</p><ul><li>Proven to perform, not just trending</li><li>Popular among Thai consumers</li><li>Suitable for everyday use</li></ul><p>Our goal is simple: make Thai beauty accessible to the world.</p><hr><h2>🌍 Our Global Customers</h2><p>Beauty Buddy proudly serves a growing international audience, with the majority of our customers coming from:</p><ul><li>🇺🇸 United States</li><li>🇦🇺 Australia</li><li>🇪🇺 Europe</li></ul><p>This global demand creates strong opportunities for partners to tap into high-converting markets.</p><hr><h2>🤝 Partner With Us (Affiliate Program)</h2><p>We’re not just a store—we’re a platform for growth.</p><p>Whether you're a:</p><ul><li>Content creator (TikTok, YouTube, Instagram)</li><li>Influencer or community builder</li><li>Or someone exploring online income</li></ul><p>You can start earning by promoting our products to a global audience.</p><hr><h2>💰 Why Join Our Affiliate Program?</h2><ul><li><strong>High-demand niche</strong>: Thai beauty is trending globally</li><li><strong>Worldwide shipping</strong>: No geographic limitations</li><li><strong>Diverse product range</strong>: Easy to match with different audiences</li><li><strong>Conversion-ready offers</strong>: Promotions and deals to support your sales</li></ul></div>",
